                                "text": "énergie renouvelable",
                                "translation": "renewable energy",
                                "english": "renewable energy"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4016d93e-e231-42cf-ac61-cbac49728a23",
                                "sense_id": "c9201fbe-cdff-3eec-bc5a-0a5645a7c285",
                                "text": "Il y a quatre ans, ce sont les jeunes qui ont porté au pouvoir le président progressiste sud-coréen, Moon Jae-in. Aujourd'hui, ils menacent la dernière année de son mandat de cinq ans non renouvelable, au risque de ramener la droite conservatrice au pouvoir.",
                                "translation": "Four years ago, it was the youth who brought the progressive South Korean president Moon Jae-in to power. Today, they are imperiling the last year of his non-renewable five-year term, at the risk of bringing the conservative right back to power.",
                                "english": "Four years ago, it was the youth who brought the progressive South Korean president Moon Jae-in to power. Today, they are imperiling the last year of his non-renewable five-year term, at the risk of bringing the conservative right back to power."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
